{"lines": [{"text": "America spent almost four cents to make every single penny.", "start": 0.1, "end": 4.06, "spec": {"img": 1, "ov": "hook"}, "words": [["America", 0.08, 0.602], ["spent", 0.784, 1.045], ["almost", 1.102, 1.443], ["four", 1.443, 1.739], ["cents", 1.75, 2.091], ["to", 2.091, 2.182], ["make", 2.182, 2.523], ["every", 2.727, 2.989], ["single", 2.989, 3.273], ["penny", 3.284, 3.625]]}, {"text": "Metal, minting, and shipping: three point six nine cents per coin.", "start": 4.26, "end": 8.604, "spec": {"img": 2, "ov": "cost"}, "words": [["Metal", 0.068, 0.375], ["minting", 0.773, 1.318], ["and", 1.591, 1.705], ["shipping", 1.716, 2.148], ["three", 2.42, 2.648], ["point", 2.648, 2.875], ["six", 2.875, 3.114], ["nine", 3.114, 3.375], ["cents", 3.386, 3.602], ["per", 3.602, 3.716], ["coin", 3.716, 4.023]]}, {"text": "And in 2024, the Mint shipped over three billion of them.", "start": 8.804, "end": 12.5, "spec": {"img": 2, "ov": "count"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.159], ["in 2024", 0.17, 1.034], ["the", 1.432, 1.489], ["Mint", 1.489, 1.67], ["shipped", 1.682, 2.102], ["over", 2.114, 2.307], ["three", 2.318, 2.682], ["billion", 2.682, 3.045], ["of", 3.057, 3.148], ["them", 3.148, 3.364]]}, {"text": "The result: an eighty-five million dollar loss. On a one-cent coin.", "start": 12.7, "end": 17.236, "spec": {"img": 3, "ov": "loss"}, "words": [["The", 0.102, 0.148], ["result", 0.148, 0.557], ["an", 0.943, 1.068], ["eighty-five", 1.182, 1.795], ["million", 1.807, 2.17], ["dollar", 2.17, 2.432], ["loss", 2.432, 2.955], ["On", 3.33, 3.398], ["a", 3.398, 3.455], ["one-cent", 3.466, 3.898], ["coin", 3.909, 4.193]]}, {"text": "It had cost more than one cent for nineteen years in a row.", "start": 17.436, "end": 20.652, "spec": {"img": 3, "ov": "years"}, "words": [["It", 0.091, 0.136], ["had", 0.136, 0.227], ["cost", 0.227, 0.523], ["more", 0.523, 0.682], ["than", 0.682, 0.864], ["one", 0.864, 1.114], ["cent", 1.125, 1.523], ["for", 1.534, 1.682], ["nineteen", 1.682, 2.136], ["years", 2.148, 2.42], ["in", 2.42, 2.466], ["a", 2.477, 2.511], ["row", 2.511, 2.886]]}, {"text": "So in November 2025, after two hundred thirty-two years, the U.S. stopped making them.", "start": 20.852, "end": 26.156, "spec": {"img": 4, "ov": "stop"}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.239], ["in", 0.239, 0.295], ["November 2025", 0.295, 1.432], ["after", 1.83, 2.08], ["two", 2.08, 2.284], ["hundred", 2.284, 2.466], ["thirty-two", 2.466, 2.909], ["years", 2.909, 3.409], ["the", 3.591, 3.659], ["U.S.", 3.659, 4.091], ["stopped", 4.091, 4.466], ["making", 4.466, 4.795], ["them", 4.795, 4.977]]}, {"text": "And the nickel? It costs almost fourteen cents to make a five-cent coin.", "start": 26.356, "end": 30.628, "spec": {"img": 5, "ov": "nickel"}, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.148], ["the", 0.148, 0.193], ["nickel", 0.193, 0.58], ["It", 0.943, 1.011], ["costs", 1.011, 1.341], ["almost", 1.409, 1.716], ["fourteen", 1.716, 2.273], ["cents", 2.284, 2.682], ["to", 2.693, 2.784], ["make", 2.784, 2.977], ["a", 2.989, 3.023], ["five-cent", 3.034, 3.636], ["coin", 3.636, 3.932]]}, {"text": "So next time you find a penny, remember:", "start": 30.828, "end": 33.108, "spec": {"img": 1, "ov": "loop"}, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.193], ["next", 0.193, 0.364], ["time", 0.364, 0.5], ["you", 0.5, 0.602], ["find", 0.602, 0.818], ["a", 0.818, 0.852], ["penny", 0.852, 1.159], ["remember", 1.409, 1.955]]}], "dur": 33.21}